{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/790328-solar-standard-xp-question","id":790328,"title":"Solar & Standard XP Question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-21T10:10:38-08:00","id":790328,"title":"Solar & Standard XP Question","content":"I apologize if this has been addressed elsewhere.<br /> <br /> With standard and Solar XP, can they be combined to buy Martial Arts charms? Or are they treated as completely separate XP?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Magma Kraken EVERYTHING!!!&quot; - A response fitting for any situation","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/162-mr_bony_hands","name":"Mr_Bony_Hands","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar162_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-21T10:27:01-08:00","id":790338,"title":"","content":"I can understand the confusion, since there is an implicit separation between the two, but in this case it's not actually complicated. Solar XP is exactly the same as regular XP, but with a couple restrictions regarding what you can spend it on. Since MA is a valid use for it, you can combine regular XP and Solar XP however you like to purchase MA charms. Same with Sorcery, Evocations, Ability dots, etc. Really the only thing you can't spend Solar XP on is, ironically, native Solar charms. There are no rules requiring you to 'batch' your XP as part of the purchase though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Share your wonders in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop#post823884\" target=\"_blank\">The Artifact and Evocation Workshop</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1315-ferryman","name":"Ferryman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1315_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"960"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-21T10:53:09-08:00","id":790349,"title":"","content":"As a small note, I see the solar XP as existing primarily to ensure people increase their abilities / attributes outside of charms. I wanna say the developers confirmed this at some point? But I can't recall when/where, so I can't source that. Either way, Ferryman is right. Can be used to buy sorcery spells, too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Stuff I've made:<br /> Ex3 Combat Flowchart &gt; <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/wnh21nkq07uuoct/Exalted%203rd%20Combat.png\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.dropbox.com/s/wnh21nkq07...d%20Combat.png</a><br /> Ex3 Battlegroup Cheatsheet &gt; <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/byc19z0coe4kzhq/Exalted%203e%20Battlegroups.png?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.dropbox.com/s/byc19z0coe...roups.png?dl=0</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9361-givenflesh","name":"GivenFlesh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9361_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-21T10:58:18-08:00","id":790351,"title":"","content":"Great! I just wanted to make sure that where the experience applications overlap, I can combine them to buy a few MA charms (I'm sure our Twilight caste member will appreciate this too). Thanks so much!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Magma Kraken EVERYTHING!!!&quot; - A response fitting for any situation","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/162-mr_bony_hands","name":"Mr_Bony_Hands","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar162_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-21T11:29:11-08:00","id":790367,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GivenFlesh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/790328-solar-standard-xp-question?p=790349#post790349\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As a small note, I see the solar XP as existing primarily to ensure people increase their abilities / attributes outside of charms. I wanna say the developers confirmed this at some point? But I can't recall when/where, so I can't source that. Either way, Ferryman is right. Can be used to buy sorcery spells, too.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a thing I've actually been curious about. That matches my understanding as well - that the purpose of Solar XP is to promote non-linear growth, to allow people to spend XP on things that aren't making them more powerful in their area of focus without feeling bad.<br /> <br /> Given that, why can it be spent on Martial Arts charms? Evocations? Buying combat charms (Martial Arts ones) - increasing your combat power very directly - seems the opposite of what Solar XP is meant to accomplish.<br /> <br /> I understand why Spells are allowed - many of them are situational, don't combine together for greater effectiveness, etc, and having more than a few is diversification, not focus. But hearing the design decisions behind SXP - which I really like - I would not have predicted the actual rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}